    prompt: 'Refer to the exhibit. The SW1 and SW2 Gi0/0 ports have been preconfigured. An engineer is given these requirements: allow all PCs to communicate with each other at Layer 3, configure untagged traffic to use VLAN 5, and disable VLAN 1 from being used. Which configuration set meets these requirements?',
